{#
    [snp] Report a finished game to the Sip n Play leaderboard.

    The second half of why this fork exists. Upstream has no concept of a game ending —
    it is purely a grimoire — so this section is entirely ours.

    Deliberately in English rather than translated. The other strings here come from
    upstream's own translation files, and adding keys that exist only in en_GB would
    render as raw keys the moment a storyteller switched language. English in every
    locale is the more predictable failure.
#}
{% embed 'includes/details.html.twig' with {
    summary: 'End Game &amp; Report',
    id: 'snp-report'
} %}
    {% block body %}
    <div id="snp-report-body" data-configured="0">

        <p class="text-small" id="snp-report-intro">
            Send this game to the Sip n Play leaderboard. Everyone on the grimoire is
            reported with the character they finished on.
        </p>

        <fieldset class="mb-4">
            <legend class="text-small">Who won?</legend>
            <p>
                <label><input type="radio" name="snp-winner" value="good"> Good wins</label>
                <label class="ml-2"><input type="radio" name="snp-winner" value="evil"> Evil wins</label>
                <label class="ml-2"><input type="radio" name="snp-winner" value="none"> No result</label>
            </p>
        </fieldset>

        <p class="text-small">
            <label for="snp-report-date">Game night</label>
            <input type="date" class="input" id="snp-report-date" name="snp-report-date">
            <span class="d-block text-small">Defaults to tonight. Change it to record a night you are catching up on.</span>
        </p>

        {# Shows exactly what is about to be sent, so a wrong seat is caught before the
           write rather than after it. #}
        <div id="snp-report-preview" class="mb-4"></div>

        <p>
            <button type="button" class="button" id="snp-report-send" disabled>
                Report game
            </button>
        </p>

        <p id="snp-report-status" class="text-small" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

    </div>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
